  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">這件物品替代了一處缺失的肢體</span>——<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">一隻手，一隻臂，一條腿或類似的身體部分。肢體安裝後，其功能與被替換的肢體相同。</span><br /><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">你可以用一個動作將其着裝或者卸裝，它不能在你非自願的情況下被移除。它會在你死的時候脫落</span></p>",
